<title>ROMANIA: Romania six-month current account gap $520 mln.</title>
<headline>Romania six-month current account gap $520 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's current account deficit widened to $520 million over January-June from $422 million in the first five months of this year but dropped from the year-ago level of $786 million, National Bank data showed.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN CURRENT A/C	    JAN-JUNE 96	    JAN-JUNE 96</p>
<p> Current account (mln USD)	-520		     -786</p>
<p> Trade balance			-499		     -725</p>
<p> Exports (FOB)		     3,344		    3,726</p>
<p> Imports (FOB)		     3,843		    4,451</p>
<p> Services balance		    -52			-96</p>
<p> Income balance		     -139			-96</p>
<p> Current transfers balance	 170			131</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
